{{Dex/Form|Normal}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Sun|entry=It changes its form depending on the weather. Changes in the temperature or humidity appear to affect its cellular structure.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Moon|entry=Its form changes on its own, due to its cells' sensitive reactions to temperature and humidity.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Ultra Sun|t=FFF|entry=Although its form changes with the weather, that is apparently the result of a chemical reaction and not the result of its own free will.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Ultra Moon|t=FFF|entry=Its form changes depending on the weather. The rougher conditions get, the rougher Castform's disposition!}}
{{Dex/Form|Sunny Form}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Sun|entry=This is the form Castform takes on the brightest of days. Its skin is unexpectedly hot to the touch, so approach with care.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Moon|entry=This is Castform's form when basking in fair weather. Its body is warm and toasty.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Ultra Sun|t=FFF|entry=This is the form Castform takes on bright days. In an experiment where Castform was placed in front of a heater, it didn't change to this form.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Ultra Moon|t=FFF|entry=Castform changes to this form when it basks in bright sunlight. When you touch its glowing skin, it feels all dried out!}}
{{Dex/Form|Rainy Form}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Sun|entry=This is the form Castform takes when soaked with rain. When its body is compressed, water will seep out as if from a sponge.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Moon|entry=This is Castform's form during a downpour of rain. Its body retains moisture and gets slippery.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Ultra Sun|t=FFF|entry=Castform changes to this form when rain hits it. Its body is soft and slightly swollen with water.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Ultra Moon|t=FFF|entry=This is Castform's form when pelted by rain. In an experiment where it was placed in a shower, this Pokémon didn't change to this form.}}
{{Dex/Form|Snowy Form}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Sun|entry=This is the form Castform takes when covered in snow. Its body becomes an ice-like material, with a temperature near {{tt|23 degrees Fahrenheit|−5 degrees Celsius}}.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Moon|entry=This is Castform's form when caught in a hailstorm. Its cold skin is as smooth as ice.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Ultra Sun|t=FFF|entry=This is the form Castform takes when hit by hail. In an experiment where it was placed in a freezer, it didn't change to this form.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Ultra Moon|t=FFF|entry=This is Castform's form when caught in a hailstorm. Its whole body is chilled, and its skin is partially frozen!}}
